     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/what-the-hack-travel-with-kids/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par10/separator_copy_copy__691610613"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Did You Know? Lufthansa Is the Most Family-Friendly Airline in the World!</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_11"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Lufthansa places a strong emphasis on making flights special for their youngest passengers. With thoughtful services on the ground and in the air, Lufthansa provides a seamless and family-friendly travel experience, earning them the 2025 World Airline Award for Most Family-Friendly Airline.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_12"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Airport Adventures</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_13"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Even before takeoff, kids should get a taste of the flying experience. Many airports have family check-in counters where children can climb a small staircase to watch the process. Even stuffed animals get their own boarding pass! During school holidays, Lufthansa mascots Lu and Cosmo make surprise appearances in Frankfurt, Munich, and Berlin, handing out autograph cards and taking photos with young fans. Kids are also welcome in Lufthansa lounges, where coloring books, card games, crayons, bottles, and gym bags await. At Easter and Christmas, there are extra festive surprises.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_14"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Kids' Meals</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_15"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Up to 24 hours before departure, fun meals with names like \"Noodle Volcano,\" \"Chicken Mutiny,\" or \"Clown Wrap\" can be preordered under \"Special Meals.\" Popular options include pasta, meatballs, and sausages. Trays are decorated with Lufthansa mascots Lu and Cosmo, and the menu includes coloring sheets and riddles to keep little ones busy. Kids' meals are available in all classes on long-haul flights and in Business Class on short-haul routes.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_16"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>In-Flight Entertainment</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_17"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "From a cloud-shaped snuggle cloth for babies to a round of \"City, Country, Plane\" – all Lufthansa planes are stocked with age-appropriate toys. There are also tons of coloring sheets available through the Lufthansa eJournal home page, including a special kids' travel guide: the \"Kids Travel Book.\" On long-haul flights, kids can enjoy movies, series, music, audiobooks, and podcasts. A highlight on selected aircraft is the cockpit camera that lets kids watch the flight from the pilot's POV.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_18"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Kids’ Amenity Kit</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_19"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Packed in a waterproof pouch that's perfect for reuse, the amenity kit includes airplane-themed socks, a kids' eye mask, a toothbrush shaped like a plane, lip balm, tiny earplugs, a plush airplane, gummy bears, chocolate, a logbook, and the new \"Kids Travel Book\" from Lufthansa Insights. Available on long-haul flights in First, Business, and Premium Economy Class, and on short-haul Business Class flights – making time on board fly by in the best way.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_20"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Copyrights: Getty Images, EvaExplora, Getty Images",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_21"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>About</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_22"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Stefanie Pröstler-Meckl and her husband Maximilian have been traveling the world together for years. These days, they're joined by their four-year-old son and two-year-old daughter. Whether it's Mexico, Thailand, Malaysia, or Morocco, Pröstler-Meckl takes her Instagram community (@evaexplora) along for the ride and shares travel tips for Germany, Europe, and beyond on her blog EvaExplora.com.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/non-destination/what-the-hack--flying-with-kids-–-tips-for-relaxed-family-flights_paragraph_23"
     }
    ],
